        "id": "Extension",
        "path": "Extension",
        "short": "Analysis Exception",
        "definition": "Indicates that values for the element of the data requirement on which it appears could not be determined due to a processing exception, with a message describing the exception. For example, the `code` element of a code filter may have an exception indicating the value could not be determined for function references.",
        "comment": "The extension may repeat to indicate multiple processing exceptions for the same element.",
